{"id":"8311ab8098e68fa0","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-image.md","title":"Categorical Image","display":"df-image — Categorical Image","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-image","aliases":["93-df-image"],"display":"df-image — Categorical Image","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-morphism]]","[[93-df-monomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-image — Categorical Image"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58d8bff43d6d4102\" href=\"?note=58d8bff43d6d4102\" title=\"93-df-monomorphism\">93-df-monomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (the object and hom-set projections of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58d8bff43d6d4102\" href=\"?note=58d8bff43d6d4102\" title=\"93-df-monomorphism\">93-df-monomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Image}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Image}_{93}\\)</span> (the image-factorization predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}image}\\vdash \\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,I\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(e,A,I,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,I,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}e\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,J)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(J,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(n,J,B,\\mathcal C)\\land f=n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}q\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\exists!r\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(I,J)\\;\n(n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m\\land r\\circ_{\\mathcal C}e=q)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}image}\\vdash \\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,I\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(e,A,I,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,I,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}e\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,J)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(J,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(n,J,B,\\mathcal C)\\land f=n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}q\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\exists!r\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(I,J)\\;\n(n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m\\land r\\circ_{\\mathcal C}e=q)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The mono <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:I\\to B\">\\(m:I\\to B\\)</span> is the least subobject of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> through which <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> factors. The universal clause fixes the intended categorical image rather than merely naming an arbitrary mono factorization.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ (the object and hom-set projections of [[93-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ (see [[93-df-morphism]] and [[93-df-monomorphism]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ (see [[93-df-morphism]] and [[93-df-monomorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Image}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}image}\\vdash \\mathrm{Image}_{93}(I,e,m,f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,I\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(e,A,I,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,I,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land f=m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}e\\\\\n&\\land\\forall J\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,J)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(J,B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(n,J,B,\\mathcal C)\\land f=n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}q\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\exists!r\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(I,J)\\;\n(n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m\\land r\\circ_{\\mathcal C}e=q)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"m:I\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1567,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a0e4e3dae0f2467","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["aa74a8a